# Development and release tooling. Never installed in either shipped image.
#
# The security scanners moved to audit.in in Phase B2. `pip-audit` stays here as well,
# because a contributor changing a dependency should be able to audit it without
# installing Semgrep — and scripts/lock.sh pins both layers in one pass, so the two
# cannot drift apart. check_pins.py enforces that: any package in more than one lockfile
# must be at one version.
#
# Edit this file, then run scripts/lock.sh. Never edit dev.txt by hand.
-r score.in
